  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners Innovation Fund Investment Readiness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the lessons learnt from the Orange Corners Innovation Fund (OCIF) Impact Evaluation of August 2022, this project attempts to prepare OCIF graduates for commercial impact investments. Tailormade support for eight young entrepreneurs should help them to bridge the financing gap and allow them to grow further. This project will be implemented from December 2023 to June 2024 and will support at least eight entrepreneurs from C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire, Ghana, Morocco and Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
